: "https://si.imgix.net/cb9682c8/uploads/origins/6c48b09c-ef90-4154-9eb9-74a1a6468bde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=238c6bb667f1bd2f9604cf26ce36e7ee", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, I love your art!\nI would like to have an artwork of my Vtuber character Milky.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1VWCJuYVulbE2Oxw_3XVwTwE5n3PNii2Q/view?usp=drive_link\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ohcBYwcKf814WpV61NNTJvgx7HJ_Ijn4/view?usp=drive_link\n\nShe is a strawberry milk cow girl who is a bit mischievous and seductive! For the expression, could I request something a little seductive / cheeky?\n\nI hope that you could do a version with and without background ( PNG )\n\nThank you!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@djmmk92/works/103", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 485067, "client_id": 3095554, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a230568/uploads/origins/21b21a6b-ea96-4a20-9c09-c9e9401767d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d619bc775db78a569e9b9a02aa6ed4f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a230568/uploads/origins/21b21a6b-ea96-4a20-9c09-c9e9401767d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=801fe345973f9cd081b52fe09dc42013", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、この前の落書きページが大好きです。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@djmmk92/works/91\n\n今回は新しい衣装で\n\n衣装: https://drive.google.com/file/d/19bIqeZMIP4Jgrh55ekxnH7H9zif5xTDn/view?usp=drive_link\nキャラクター：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PIc3LFE4OPMOwp9w01MZlXPNaeu54bOx/view?usp=drive_link\n\n納品物\n可能であれば、背景を分離したPSDファイルで共有ください。\n\n用途\nSNSサイトやグッズに。お名前をクレジットさせていただきます！\n\nこの度はご依頼いただきありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Fef3pvkG4ZvcTwUcMKl38n4Jmt0J-LCA?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@djmmk92/works/102", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 485067, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ccc6a82/uploads/origins/e652b987-0f34-4a76-9ed0-b19a33260827?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da553d0471a7acd24bdb3b712ce00f39", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ccc6a82/uploads/origins/e652b987-0f34-4a76-9ed0-b19a33260827?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=484105fdd28873f5b9e40c3bf4297fb6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "架空VTuberの蛸之目たすくを描いていただきたいです！可愛い感じでお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1nMCJJYq-e6KXpDgQAcXpSt47WM-yFqho/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@djmmk92/works/101", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 485067, "client_id": 3531426, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2433c0d5/uploads/origins/0a4cde2b-ba5e-473b-bd04-ab2428a44022?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9871877c99740a1565264a0e27840e47", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2433c0d5/uploads/origins/0a4cde2b-ba5e-473b-bd04-ab2428a44022?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4456edc4231d0f1ea19b5025afe446b7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "私と好きな子のコテキャをかいて欲しいです❣️ポーズはお任せします！一人はピンクハーフツインテールで前髪はパッツン、姫カットの下からもみあげがでてます。目はジト目の黒色の瞳でハイライトなしめです！もう一人は黒髪ウルフカットで、正面から見て右側にオレンジ色のメッシュが入ってます！（もみあげが左右非対称で、オレンジインナーが入ってる方のもみあげが顎下くらいまであります）また、インナーカラーとしてオレンジ色が入ってます！ギザ歯です。目はちょっとつり目気味で、右側の瞳がオレンジ色で、左目は黒です！ハイライトは入ってると幸です。どちらもメイド服着ててほしいです……！！！よろしくお願いします！！！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@djmmk92/works/100", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 485067, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/927e4637/uploads/origins/2cd63771-511a-489e-8fbc-9e5fceb8140c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78855afc45592dfb2660c1a806a6acc8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/927e4637/uploads/origins/2cd63771-511a-489e-8fbc-9e5fceb8140c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=39851807359cf255c111e425d0496011", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。私のキャラクター、ベラの作品を依頼したいです。作品としては、フードをかぶって、両手でハートのジェスチャーをしながら、小さく微笑んで、かわいくポーズをとってほしいです。よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1O4tjR14MnuE9hU8u9M_MyoF11UdzdLW6", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@djmmk92/works/99", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 485067, "client_id": 3453936, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea619260/uploads/origins/494b0858-7800-46d0-ab78-480cf322f2ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15d55148fd42c07b8ed0027c36864ac4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea619260/uploads/origins/494b0858-7800-46d0-ab78-480cf322f2ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=288b8a3553d5c864e13e38a53dbe2194", "src_set": ""}, "body": "鏡音ももこ🍑さんと他99人　さま\n\n初めまして。\n個人でvtuberをしています、梨*（@nashi__